/**
 * Confines the tab order to the slide on screen. Renders nothing --- it exists
 * so a deck can pull in the script, because astromotion owns the deck route's
 * `<head>` and offers no hook to inject one (its options are theme,
 * injectRoutes, routePrefix, checkStructure, shikiConfig; "Head assets" is
 * favicon and ogImage only). Import it at the top of every `.deck.mdx`.
 */
---

<script src="../../scripts/deck-focus.ts"></script>
